"segments": [
{
"start": 40.29,
"end": 44.87,
"text": " Jackson canceled his concert, but his last two concerts were dedicated to her."
},
{
"start": 44.89,
"end": 47.77,
"text": "He doesn't pretend that she was a close friend."
},
{
"start": 48.23,
"end": 49.05,
"text": "She was a fan."
},
{
"start": 50.32,
"end": 54.68,
"text": "I met her first at a concert in London."
},
{
"start": 55.42,
"end": 60.5,
"text": "She was very kind, very loving, very sweet."
},
{
"start": 61.18,
"end": 62.46,
"text": "What did you two talk about?"
},
{
"start": 63.04,
"end": 64.76,
"text": "I wrote a song called Dirty Diana."
},
{
"start": 66.19,
"end": 73.99,
"text": " And it's not about Lady Diana, it's about certain kind of girls that hang around concerts or clubs."
},
{
"start": 74.47,
"end": 76.25,
"text": "You know, they call them groupies."
},
{
"start": 77.08,
"end": 78.32,
"text": "I've lived in that all my life."
},
{
"start": 78.34,
"end": 82.12,
"text": "You see these girls, they do everything with the band and you know, everything you can imagine."
},
{
"start": 82.76,
"end": 84.46,
"text": "So I wrote a song called Dirty Diana."
},
{
"start": 85.46,
"end": 90.92,
"text": "But I took it out of the show in honor of her Royal Highness."
},
{
"start": 92.12,
"end": 95.63,
"text": "And she took me away and she said,"
},
{
"start": 102.01,
"end": 108.82,
"text": " I said, no, I took it out of the show because of no, I want you to do it, do it, do the song."
},
{
"start": 109.38,
"end": 110.86,
"text": "So she had a sense of humor with you?"
},
{
"start": 111.44,
"end": 112.54,
"text": "Yeah, of course."
},
{
"start": 113.16,
"end": 119.89,
"text": "And she told me she was honored to meet me and I said, it's an honor to meet you."
}
]
}